1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,700
Every enterprise has more ideas than it can build.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:11,635
Put AI inside ideation, and every idea can become a software system.

3
00:00:12,985 --> 00:00:18,250
AI writes code in minutes, but an enterprise needs a system that is ready for production.

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:27,680
Akka is an AI platform that turns any idea into a system that is ready for production, and keeps it trustworthy once it runs.

5
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:38,040
Only Akka combines the path from an idea to a specification, the pipeline that builds and checks the system, and the runtime the system is built for.

6
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:45,965
Because the runtime is known before any code is generated, AI writes less, and reviewers review less.

7
00:00:47,315 --> 00:00:50,630
The design space is fixed before code is generated.

8
00:00:52,315 --> 00:00:57,470
AI generates only from Akka components, and each system is still its own design.

9
00:00:59,715 --> 00:01:10,450
The hardest requirements are satisfied by the runtime: identity, durability, replication, failover, scaling, sharding, circuit breakers, caching, and backpressure.

10
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:15,425
An enterprise's requirements are written as exit conditions.

11
00:01:16,775 --> 00:01:22,480
A machine checks each condition wherever it can, and the human attestations are recorded alongside.

12
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:26,845
The enterprise tightens the conditions where it needs to.

13
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:32,025
A conformance receipt states that the system is ready to ship.

14
00:01:34,630 --> 00:01:40,735
The laptop runtime and the production runtime are the same, so the system goes to production as it was built.

15
00:01:43,030 --> 00:01:45,835
The system stays trustworthy after the build.

16
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:55,115
The security, identity, controls, and interaction model that applied at build time also apply in production.

17
00:01:56,465 --> 00:02:04,625
Every change to a specification is documented with a machine-generated receipt of what was verified, what remains open, and any waivers.

18
00:02:05,975 --> 00:02:11,850
The receipts are an evidence trail that a requirement a user asked for was implemented and verified.

19
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:19,725
Akka captures production traces, evaluations, and cost, and they feed the next improvement to the specification.

20
00:02:21,075 --> 00:02:27,030
Akka systems run wherever you need them: in our cloud, in your datacenter, or in a sovereign cloud.

21
00:02:28,475 --> 00:02:35,945
Every idea goes through the same stations: discovery, specify, plan, build, conform, and ship.

22
00:02:37,295 --> 00:02:40,300
Every station passes versioned records to the next.

23
00:02:42,295 --> 00:02:51,550
Where a decision is ambiguous, a human is asked to provide the clarifications needed to eliminate the ambiguity, and the answers are recorded with the station's records.

24
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:57,835
The organization sees its portfolio of ideas, and where each idea stands.

25
00:02:59,185 --> 00:03:05,765
Akka can rebuild and replatform an existing system to functional and behavioral parity with the original system.

26
00:03:07,115 --> 00:03:11,045
Akka uses the existing system as a testbed and answer key.

27
00:03:12,395 --> 00:03:16,650
Feedback, spend, and human judgement decide which idea goes next.

28
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:23,945
Roadmap compression is the number of projects planned for 2028 that you deliver in 2027.

29
00:03:25,295 --> 00:03:32,900
Legacy liability reduction is the saving from the technical debt, unsupported software, mainframes, and licenses you retire.

30
00:03:34,250 --> 00:03:37,170
Every idea gets its own software factory.

31
00:03:39,250 --> 00:03:42,515
Akka is the platform for enterprise ideAItion.

32
00:03:43,865 --> 00:03:48,710
Contact us, and we will show you how we can deliver your idea in as little as a day.
